   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Overture**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **The Lady From Shanghai**: back after 300 archived shows (6013 days); rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Cold at Night**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Armies of the Lord**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Going Invisible 2**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Rocks in My Pockets**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Great Pirates**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Your Bandage**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Fishing Boat [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2025-11-30.mix.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 106 min [1]\n- **tmg2025-11-30.mk4.flac24**: source not stated; 23 songs; 106 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2025-11-30.mix.flac24**: taped by Lance Stack; transferred by Lance Stack; source: Mix [Schoeps MK4's > Vark KCY > VST 62 IUg + SBD > XLR] > Zoom F6 @ 32f/48 > SDHC [1]. Also: Brandon coordinated the SBD feed and logistics for the recording session [1]\n- **tmg2025-11-30.mk4.flac24**: taped by Lance Stack; transferred by Lance Stack; source: Schoeps MK4's > Vark KCY > VST 62 IUg > Zoom F6 @ 32f/48 > SDHC [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by bozemanmagazine.com: [The Mountain Goats - The Elm](https://bozemanmagazine.com/events/2025/11/30/190117-the-mountain-goats-at-the-elm) [4]\n- Poster by Jake Ferguson: [EVENT INFO: The Mountain Goats at The ELM 2025 - Logjam Presents](https://logjampresents.com/2025/11/25/event-info-the-mountain-goats-at-the-elm-2025/) [5]",
